[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
hawkeye-data is the knowledge kit (sibling of sysutils/hawkeye).

  pkg copy:    ${PKG_PREFIX}/share/hawkeye/knowledge.sqlite
  rescue copy: /boot/hawkeye/knowledge.sqlite

The port installs the pkg copy only. For a missing /usr or RO rescue
media, copy the sqlite (and optionally playbooks/) to /boot/hawkeye/:

  mkdir -p /boot/hawkeye
  cp ${PKG_PREFIX}/share/hawkeye/knowledge.sqlite /boot/hawkeye/

Open immutable/RO (no -wal sidecar):

  sqlite3 'file:/boot/hawkeye/knowledge.sqlite?mode=ro&immutable=1'

Never put keys, passphrases, or tokens in this corpus. zfs load-key
and geli attach are console-only; secrets must not go through an LLM.
EOM
}
]
